 "remarks": "Riverfront new construction rental -- Experience the ultimate blend of lock-and-go convenience and standalone single-family privacy. A masterclass in modern coastal architecture, this brand-new, never-lived-in, four-level waterfront home delivers all the ease of luxury condo living without sacrificing your autonomy. Perched directly on the Saugatuck River, floor-to-ceiling glass bathes the open interior with light and frames sweeping water views. Turnkey upgrades include brand-new custom Lutron automated shades throughout, integrated Audio/video system, retractable door screens, and level 3 EV charger outlet.   Spanning 1,841 thoughtfully planned square feet, the multi-level layout provides ideal privacy for working from home or hosting. The entry level features a living room with gas fireplace, eat-in-kitchen, powder room and beautiful + bright river views. The second floor features a serene primary suite with a walk-in closet, soaking tub, and steam shower. The top floor offers a private guest suite with an en-suite bath and river-view balcony, while the lower level houses a family room and a third en-suite bedroom.   Outside, a water's-edge terrace makes riverfront entertaining effortless, buffered by an adjacent park for lasting privacy. Best of all, enjoy unbeatable downtown convenience-just moments from Westport's premier dining, shops, train, and cultural destinations.",
